OL,3,AValve's Steam Frame is excellent - but
OL,4,Aat over #1,000 is VR still too
OL,5,Aexpensive?
OL,6,
OL,7,FBoth are capable of streaming from a PC
OL,8,Fas well as playing games on-device,
OL,9,Fwith varying degrees of success.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/18
